count": "5", "last_modify_ts": 1794419771176}, {"comment_id": "7669791386179601187", "create_time": 1785762467, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7669469782873279784", "content": "我闺蜜就是佤族 西盟的", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "722", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAUDzRez2b5N3DyfaKyE4RLBUQ-Q0lctKiGtj_i1WGq9w", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAUDzRez2b5N3DyfaKyE4RLBUQ-Q0lctKiGtj_i1WGq9w", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1155816298", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "小龙有虎牙~", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_923300ef7bdfabfaf29319bacbec1c16.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "14", "last_modify_ts": 1794419771176}, {"comment_id": "7669664245742666545", "create_time": 1785732863, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7669469782873279784", "content": "感谢@江寻千（九月） 对西盟非遗的关注与传播！西盟佤族自治县是《阿佤人民唱新歌》的诞生地，始终致力于民族文化的活态传承。此次与九月的相遇，是古老传统与当代视角的一次美好对话。热忱欢迎全国各地的朋友踏上这片“人类童年”的土地，亲身感受“会说话就会唱歌，会走路就会跳舞”的佤族热情，在这里，遇见最本真的云南。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "523", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAALxaZ353q3gijhxPXodiZa5FZAxWzhL2piQHGIU8IY8JHoj7VJ7hZIzWi0Pg7ByiH", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAALxaZ353q3gijhxPXodiZa5FZAxWzhL2piQHGIU8IY8JHoj7VJ7hZIzWi0Pg7ByiH", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "xmrmtzx", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "西盟融媒", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/douyin-user-private-image_c4ae2f22ddcc8bd125aa2182f405dec0_3777527892418664.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "8", "last_modify_ts": 1794419771176}, {"comment_id": "7669773626523173668", "create_time": 1785758332, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7669469782873279784", "content": "去过，现在这个地方已经被当地文旅改成酒店，然后居民按时上下班演艺在过去的生活模式让游客更有代入感。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "172", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAgUIubZOaU44ywXADqMHI0JsvxQjJmsuoI4BsxaPLGaI", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAgUIubZOaU44ywXADqMHI0JsvxQjJmsuoI4BsxaPLGaI", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "dyxrd2bls9pd", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "鱼", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oEpFIUCnAgAQsF9kAEIgfALACLrDoFjoXNOe6A.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "7", "last_modify_ts": 1794419771176}, {"comment_id": "7670194970444448563", "create_time": 1785856434, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7669469782873279784", "content": "（统一回复）云南公民不是野人，会玩手机，我可以大胆承认自己是云南人，也是佤族，但是，我们云南人真的和普通人没什么区别，老一辈的会经常穿佤族服饰，大多数还是重要日子才穿。皮肤黑有的天生，有的是后期阳光强烈造成的。云南也有高楼，请大家不要地域歧视，我爱云南，我爱中国", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "2404", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAgcQydMMaGVOX7Hnf9RHoxaZsk-Yj-8yp7ASlakzG9o-uJw-yUZsRM2nF-AsW40eD", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAgcQydMMaGVOX7Hnf9RHoxaZsk-Yj-8yp7ASlakzG9o-uJw-yUZsRM2nF-AsW40eD", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "75036883297", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "她青涩的笑", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oQXQgQvIdoAoAZqabF6DAPEAfDugfPAQ9ACIFC.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "65", "last_modify_ts": 1794419771176}, {"comment_id": "7671251267599221550", "create_time": 1786102371, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7669469782873279784", "content": "戴眼镜的那个是我舅舅[泣不成声]他是土木设计师 最近几年才退休的 我舅舅他从小到大就非常喜欢研究我们佤族文化 希望传承下去 然后他还写了一本书 但是只出版了200本 如果有人想要了解我们佤族文化 我可以送大家 我舅舅也是非常愿意的 其中的好多故事真的很有趣", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "489", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA0Ug8xe7f_t8OXEsrblYO5SQ93MxUzhOEsQFjmJLyxBwn9lJ2ogfjxdxhXErjVa9D", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA0Ug8xe7f_t8OXEsrblYO5SQ93MxUzhOEsQFjmJLyxBwn9lJ2ogfjxdxhXErjVa9D", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "Run_524_Nan_124", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "kuku湘", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/